  "sourceConclusion": [
    "Independent exact Git diff confirms all three production edits are each-block policy declarations/comments only. ABI, identity, quote request/formula, runtime byte generation, settlement guards, receiver and amount/tolerance semantics unchanged.",
    "The standard ERC4626/Silo missing refresh is grounded in selected deployed oracle/time and external CDO strategy/accounting dependencies; Fluid external Liquidity/clock source joins are separately retained and source reviewed. Fresh scheduling tests exercise actual production Family registration, lifecycle, root, coordinator, Exact and effective publication with explicitly synthetic transport responses.",
    "The actual scanner uses current effective rows, never raw bootstrap fallback for failed/unquoted rows. Keeping raw bootstrap mids and their original provenance while refreshing effective quotes is the existing live contract; this certificate does not claim every raw value is recomputed."
  ],
